com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/d27f981911458dc06b9bf6eb8b0768c7.avif?t=1773396397\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into dangerous endless territories, uncovering the secrets of the apocalypse that changed the world forever and the histories of rival factions with each expedition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/bd8e49749298f9c7bb3cd884eb5a4df5.poster.avif?t=1773396397\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/bd8e49749298f9c7bb3cd884eb5a4df5.webm?t=1773396397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/bd8e49749298f9c7bb3cd884eb5a4df5.mp4?t=1773396397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/68b754ab06c5e4808dc1f16446d097fd.avif?t=1773396397\" width=600 height=64 /></span>Encounter a variety of characters and factions. Form alliances or incite rivalries, making strategic choices that forge your path and shape your story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/7b9a34403bf00b9b8fc4941fa28fa939.poster.avif?t=1773396397\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/7b9a34403bf00b9b8fc4941fa28fa939.webm?t=1773396397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/7b9a34403bf00b9b8f